### Revised Rule

The input contains multiple layers separated by horizontal lines of color 1 (which acts as a separator). Each layer is a contiguous block of rows between two separator rows (or between the top/bottom edge and a separator). Within each layer, there are objects of various colors (excluding 0 and 1). The transformation extracts two types of objects:

