### Revised Rule

After analyzing the training examples, I've identified a consistent transformation:

1. **Identify all connected components (objects) of color 2** (using 4-connectivity). Also identify all other non-background objects (colors other than 0 and 2).

2. **For each color-2 object:**
   - Determine if it is adjacent (orthogonally) to any cell of a different non-background color (call this color X). If yes, proceed.
   - Replace the entire color-2 object with zeros (color 0).
