However, in Example 1, there is a solid rectangle of color 8 at the bottom right (rows 14-23, columns 25-28) that touches the right edge. Its size is 10×4. Taking the top-left 10×4 rectangle of the input would yield a 10×4 output, but the actual output is 9×4. Moreover, the output values do not match the top-left rectangle of the input.

