### Proposed Rule
For each cell with color 3, examine its four orthogonal neighbors (up, down, left, right). If none of these neighbors is color 3, then replace the cell with the most frequent color among those neighbors that are not 0. If all neighbors are 0, replace with 0. Otherwise, keep it as 3.

